Description: Desktop player for Heartland Public Radio
 An unofficial GTK 4 player for Heartland Public Radio: Classic Country and
 Bluegrass Gospel, commercial-free.
 .
 Live channels with album art and a recently played list, automatic
 reconnecting when the stream drops, Good 'N Country episodes on demand with
 resume, and media-key / sound-menu control (MPRIS). The channel list comes
 from the same channels.json the Android app uses.
